# Environment files.
# .env itself stays tracked: it holds only VITE_* publishable values (project
# URL + anon key) that are compiled into the client bundle anyway, and Lovable's
# build expects it in the repo. Everything below is where real secrets end up -
# service role keys, provider secrets - and must never be committed.
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.env.development.local
*.env
!.env
service-account*.json
